# Deploys do Vercel (apps/pre-copol, apps/attendee) empacotam a partir da
# raiz do monorepo pra resolver workspaces — sem esse arquivo, diretórios
# pesados e irrelevantes pro Next.js (build nativo do app mobile, node_modules
# de outros workspaces) entram no upload e estouram o limite de tamanho.
node_modules
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/node_modules
apps/mobile/modules/*/android/build
apps/attendee/.next
apps/attendee/node_modules
apps/admin/node_modules
apps/admin/dist
apps/backend/node_modules
apps/backend/dist
apps/pre-copol/.next
apps/pre-copol/node_modules
tools/scanner-poc-android
assets/brand
